{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《九運會客室2》節目男主持Brian因頻繁爆粗備受網民爭議，圈內藝人對此行徑卻抱持截然不同態度。他近日在網上節 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《九運會客室2》節目男主持Brian因頻繁爆粗備受網民爭議，圈內藝人對此行徑卻抱持截然不同態度。他近日在網上節目中大爆猛料，坦承自己滿口粗言穢語其實是向一位知名影后偷師！ </p>\n<h2>粗口Brian親自剖白銅鑼灣街頭向影后偷師學爆粗</h2>\n<p>男主持Brian近期在網上節目《24/7 Talk》中閒談期間，突然親自解開網民對他粗泛濫口疑惑。他憶述多年前在銅鑼灣皇室堡遇到一名港女高聲講電話，全程操流利廣東話粗言穢語，讓他驚覺粗口居然有這種表達方式，感嘆港式粗口「原來可以咁樣用」。他回頭一看才赫然，發現對方正是影后張柏芝，同場主持笑指這番言論恐怕要遭自我審查刪減，最終片段仍如常對外公開。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542808669933089_1361798856b040ef777f18.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 下午5.31.16.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542808669933089_1361798856b040ef777f18.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Brian憶述當日街頭聽到影后講電話，粗口的應用方式令他大開眼界。（圖片來源：《24/7 Talk》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542808942739072_10290341236b040ef9c022a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"RTay2uTZ0DyJowki5hd5vhNpOqaInbOhNlzf3zZc398.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542808942739072_10290341236b040ef9c022a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張柏芝比Brian年輕6歲，私下豪邁作風坊間不時略有所聞，但貴為影后幕前風格與Brian截然不同，（圖片來源：《忘不了》劇照）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳展鵬罕有發聲直指粗言穢語屬「廣東話精髓」</h2>\n<p>圈中出名是愛妻號兼好爸爸演員陳展鵬對Brian的爆粗作風展現出超乎想像包容度。他早前曾在社交平台轉發Brian訪問片段，強烈認同粗言穢語是「廣東話文化精髓」，只要用於表達情緒而非鬧人便沒有問題。他更發文直言<b><strong>「有太多PK掩飾自己唔講粗口」</strong></b>，大膽言論令大批網民感到震驚，甚至有人留言跪求他親自錄製爆粗語音檔作生日禮物。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809113593342_20367034366b040efbbc217.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB視帝轉發Brian訪問力撐「粗口文化」炮轟虛偽人士 網民一爆笑要求引熱議/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809113593342_20367034366b040efbbc217.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：網絡截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>馮德倫錄影節目難忍連番不雅字眼面露難色</h2>\n<p>另一邊廂馮德倫面對這種極致粗口文化卻顯得相當抗拒。早前Brian錄影節目大談日本漫畫《去吧！稻中乒團》時，全程毫無顧忌地狂爆極度不雅字眼。馮德倫聽後瞬間面露尷尬神色，更忍不住當場反問對方「你以前係咪咁多粗口？」 大批觀眾事後亦批評該集充滿災難級粗俗言詞，嚴重影響觀感並完全蓋過原本應有內容。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809340894002_13775538026b040efdbb589.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6a733ef618f8c7.78965454.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809340894002_13775538026b040efdbb589.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>馮德倫對住Brian粗口泛濫的主持風格面露難食。（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>前輩夏文汐受訪被惹怒當場直斥拍檔準備不足</h2>\n<p>60歲資深女星夏文汐獲邀上節目時完全無法忍受這種災難級表現。Brian不僅坦承未曾觀看她去年熱播劇集《新聞女王2》，更聲稱看過她參演《寒戰1994》。一向優雅從容夏文汐當場直斥伍姑娘拍檔「唔掂」，並開口奉勸「呢套你又冇聽過，冇睇過？咁你要睇返。」。事件隨即在Threads及YouTube引發洗版式聲討，網民強烈要求電視台順應民意剔除男主持。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809416320602_16670116616b040efe89926.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"孖伍詠薇主持惹公憤 Brian零功課狂爆粗 夏文汐頂唔順當場呻「唔掂」/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809416320602_16670116616b040efe89926.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>廿四味李凱賢自幼移居香港屢創網絡爆紅金句</h2>\n<p>惹起全城熱議李凱賢本身是著名Hip Hop組合廿四味成員兼電影演員。出身印尼華僑家庭他在1985年以11歲之齡隨家人移居香港，其後曾赴日本東京修讀日文。他於2025年底至2026年初期間，在網上以中英夾雜及誇張生動方式點評燒味，成功創造出「Hermès版叉燒」等爆紅金句。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/17721028138258531_213551602469a0249e2a3ab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"楊偲泳 夜王 （圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1HK）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/17721028138258531_213551602469a0249e2a3ab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Brian曾經出言不遜形容張振朗女友身材，引起不少風波。（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176896556395778587_937704691697045bc4aad8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"廿四味 brian （圖片來源：IG相片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176896556395778587_937704691697045bc4aad8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b9%9d%e9%81%8b%e6%9c%83%e5%ae%a2%e5%ae%a42/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九運會客室2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%8f%e6%96%87%e6%b1%90/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">夏文汐</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bb%bf%e5%9b%9b%e5%91%b3brian/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">廿四味Brian</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3548798\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:43:51.881843+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1604,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:01:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:30.470207+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:37:21.474112+00:00","content_hash":"4a6efc5a4e1b095118f3ae74b68053cb4f05fa1113ffe9233ad02dff36015710","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}